{"sections":[],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultPosition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE15defaultPositionyQrAA9UnitPointVF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","title":"defaultPosition(_:)","symbolKind":"method"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent\/defaultposition(_:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Sets a default position for a window.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultPosition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"position","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"position","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","isActive":true},{"text":" that specifies where to place a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"newly opened window relative to the screen bounds.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that uses a default position for new windows."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first time your app opens a window from a particular scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declaration, the system places the window at the center of the screen by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default. For scene types that support multiple simultaneous windows, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system offsets each additional window by a small amount to avoid"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completely obscuring existing windows."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can override the default placement of the first window by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"applying a scene modifier that indicates where to place the window","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"relative to the screen bounds. For example, you can request that the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"system place a new window in the bottom trailing corner of the screen:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        .defaultPosition(.bottomTrailing)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system aligns the point in the window that corresponds to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specified "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with the point in the screen that corresponds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the same unit point."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You typically use one of the predefined unit points — like"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint\/bottomTrailing"},{"type":"text","text":" in the above example — but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you can also use a custom unit point. For example, the following"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modifier aligns the point that’s one quarter of the way from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leading edge of the window with the point that’s one quarter of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the way from the leading edge of the screen, while centering the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"window in the y-dimension:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["WindowGroup {","    ContentView()","}",".defaultPosition(UnitPoint(x: 0.25, y: 0.5))"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The modifier affects any scene type that creates windows in macOS,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"namely:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Window"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"DocumentGroup","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Settings","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The value that you provide acts only as an initial default. During state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restoration, the system restores the window to the position that it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last occupied."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent\/defaultPosition(_:)"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"OpenSwiftUI","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ModifiedContent":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent","type":"topic","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ModifiedContent"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"ModifiedContent","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ModifiedContent"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ModifiedContent/defaultPosition(_:)":{"title":"defaultPosition(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultPosition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Sets a default position for a window.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent\/defaultPosition(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent\/defaultposition(_:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Scene","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A part of an app’s user interface with a life cycle managed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system."}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Scene","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UnitPoint/bottomTrailing":{"role":"symbol","title":"bottomTrailing","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A point that’s in the bottom, trailing corner of a view."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint\/bottomTrailing","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bottomTrailing","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/unitpoint\/bottomtrailing"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/WindowGroup":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WindowGroup","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WindowGroup","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup","abstract":[{"text":"A scene that presents a group of identically structured windows.","type":"text"}],"title":"WindowGroup"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UnitPoint":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"UnitPoint"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"UnitPoint"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/unitpoint","title":"UnitPoint","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A normalized 2D point in a view’s coordinate space."}]}}}